{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22441","headline":"荅元郎中杨员外喜乌见寄 · 白居易","name":"荅元郎中杨员外喜乌见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南宫鸳鸯地，何忽乌来止。\n故人锦帐郎，闻乌笑相视。\n疑乌报消息，望我归乡里。\n我归应待乌头白，慙媿元郎误欢喜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22441.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22441","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}